# 00-project-control/

The control center for `{{PROJECT_NAME}}`. Holds **live state** and
**tracking logs**. Files here are read at the start of every AI session.

## Allowed files at this root

| File                | Purpose                                  |
| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| `README.md`         | This file                                |
| `current-state.yml` | Single source of truth for project state |
| `active-work.md`    | Human-readable pointer to active work    |
| `project-status.md` | Stakeholder-facing status summary        |

No other file is allowed at this root. Everything else lives in a
subfolder.

## Subfolders

| Folder       | Purpose                                            |
| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------- |
| `registers/` | Document register + completion matrix              |
| `logs/`      | Progress log + per-sprint archives                 |
| `questions/` | Open-question log + per-question files + resolved  |
| `decisions/` | Decision log                                       |
| `risks/`     | Risk and assumption log                            |
| `quality/`   | Quality score, improvement log, retrospectives     |
| `archive/`   | Archived items moved out of active tracking        |

## AI usage rules

- `current-state.yml` is read-write — keep it small and current.
- Tracking files are **not numbered**.
- Run `compact-project-memory` when files exceed
  `.harness/quality.yml.memory_management` thresholds.
